tion: 67,998\n- Personnel benefits: 4,737\n- Benefits for former personnel: 354\n\nContractual services and supplies:\n\n\n- Travel and transportation costs appear to be significant\n- Various service-related expenses total a substantial amount\n\nI'll calculate the total service-related obligations by summing these line items. The non-service related categories include capital assets, grants, insurance claims, interest, and other non-service expenditures.\n\nThe total outside obligations reach 614,968, with service-related obligations comprising roughly 60% of this amount at 371,825.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_2d1dd17054e140349ce92d7d","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\n# Based on Table FO-1, calculate service-related vs non-service related obligations\n\n# From the table, \"Outside\" column (in millions)\npersonal_services = 67998 + 4737 + 354  # Personnel compensation + Personnel benefits + Benefits for former personnel\ncontractual_services = 2458 + 3415 + 5919 + 169 + 71362  # Travel, Transportation, Rent/comm/utilities, Printing, Other services\n\nservice_related = personal_services + contractual_services\n\n# Total gross obligations incurred outside the Federal Government\ntotal_outside = 614968\n\n# Non-service related\nnon_service_related = total_outside - service_related\n\n# Calculate percentage\npercentage_not_service_related = (non_service_related / total_outside) * 100\n\nprint(f\"Personal services: {personal_services}\")\nprint(f\"Contractual services: {contractual_services}\")\nprint(f\"Total service-related: {service_related}\")\nprint(f\"Total outside: {total_outside}\")\nprint(f\"Non-service related: {non_service_related}\")\nprint(f\"Percentage not service-related: {percentage_not_service_related}\")\nprint(f\"Rounded: {round(percentage_not_service_related)}\")\nEOF"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true